MID_SE_Ism_Kai_A: <EDH>
MID_SE_Ism_Kai_A_001: *sigh*
MID_SE_Ism_Kai_A_002: Oh. Promised One. Why are you up at this hour?
MID_SE_Ism_Kai_A_003: <NCA>"I could ask you the same question."
MID_SE_Ism_Kai_A_004: I was just thinking about something.
MID_SE_Ism_Kai_A_005: While you weren't here, I was constantly fighting\nrisen dead.
MID_SE_Ism_Kai_A_006: I was trying so hard, day and night, to keep everyone\nin Ribeira safe.
MID_SE_Ism_Kai_A_007: But there were times when people fell right in front\nof me. I was thinking about the ones I couldn't help.
MID_SE_Ism_Kai_A_008: <NCA>"Does it still hurt, even now?"
MID_SE_Ism_Kai_A_009: Yes. Sometimes. But, well, just recently some\ntownsfolk we defended... They thanked us.
MID_SE_Ism_Kai_A_010: But I start thinking about the ones I couldn't save, \nand I felt like I didn't deserve their thanks.
MID_SE_Ism_Kai_A_011: I just feel so wretched and worthless sometimes. Like\nI'm being crushed by a huge weight.
MID_SE_Ism_Kai_A_012: <NCA>"You don't show it outwardly."
MID_SE_Ism_Kai_A_013: That's because I have friends.
MID_SE_Ism_Kai_A_014: Whatever tough times we face, the fact that\neveryone is there for me helps me through.
MID_SE_Ism_Kai_A_015: Because of them, I can stand up. I can get back on\nmy feet for their sake.
MID_SE_Ism_Kai_A_016: Heh. I'm getting carried away, talking like this.\nIt's late, and I'm tired.
MID_SE_Ism_Kai_A_017: But I get the feeling that you'll listen to anything I\nhave to say.
MID_SE_Ism_Kai_A_018: <NCA>"That's only natural. We're friends."
MID_SE_Ism_Kai_A_019: <NCB>"You can always rely on me."
MID_SE_Ism_Kai_A_020: <ACA>Ha! Yeah, we're friends. Still trying to wrap my head\naround that. Thank you.
MID_SE_Ism_Kai_A_021: <ACB>Heh, yeah, thanks. Really. I do rely on you.
MID_SE_Ism_Kai_A_022: Promised One, I feel like you're not just strong, but\nyou're big too. I'm not explaining it very well.
MID_SE_Ism_Kai_A_023: I mean, you take care of each of us, but you take\ncare of all of us too.
MID_SE_Ism_Kai_A_024: Anyway... I should head over to the training grounds.
MID_SE_Ism_Kai_A_025: I can't stay still lately. I just want to get stronger and\nstronger so I can protect everyone.
MID_SE_Ism_Kai_A_026: <NCA>"I'll come with you."
MID_SE_Ism_Kai_A_027: Sure! Yeah, it'll be a better session if I'm training\nwith you.
MID_SE_Ism_Kai_S: <EDH>
MID_SE_Ism_Kai_S_001: Promised One!
MID_SE_Ism_Kai_S_002: Hah! It is you! I was surprised to see you pop up\nout of nowhere.
MID_SE_Ism_Kai_S_003: <NCA>"I made you worry."
MID_SE_Ism_Kai_S_004: <NCB>"Sorry it took me so long."
MID_SE_Ism_Kai_S_005: <ACA>Hehehe. I wasn't worried.
MID_SE_Ism_Kai_S_006: <ACB>No need to apologize. You're here safe and sound\nafter all.
MID_SE_Ism_Kai_S_007: I always believed you were alive and that we'd meet\nagain. Welcome back, Promised One.
MID_SE_Ism_Kai_S_008: <NCA>"It's good to be here, Cai."
MID_SE_Ism_Kai_S_009: Oh! Come with me. There's something you\nshould see.
MID_SE_Ism_Kai_S_010: Everyone in Dagsion. Living happy lives.
MID_SE_Ism_Kai_S_011: Little by little, life is returning to the way it was.\nAnd there are more smiling faces now.
MID_SE_Ism_Kai_S_012: We really did it. We won. We restored peace.
MID_SE_Ism_Kai_S_013: But, the world...
MID_SE_Ism_Kai_S_014: <NCA>"Still has people in need of rescue."
MID_SE_Ism_Kai_S_015: <NCB>"Still has battles to fight."
MID_SE_Ism_Kai_S_016: <ACA>That's...exactly what I was going to say.
MID_SE_Ism_Kai_S_017: <ACB>Heh. Incredible, Promised One. It's like you read\nmy mind.
MID_SE_Ism_Kai_S_018: We don't have to fear the risen dead anymore, but\nthere are still people suffering out there.
MID_SE_Ism_Kai_S_019: So we have to keep fighting. For them.
MID_SE_Ism_Kai_S_020: I want to be like you, strong enough to protect the\npeace of the whole world.
MID_SE_Ism_Kai_S_021: Strong enough to keep Dagda safe for Mom and\neveryone else. 
MID_SE_Ism_Kai_S_022: <NCA>"You're a future general."
MID_SE_Ism_Kai_S_023: General? I haven't thought that far ahead.
MID_SE_Ism_Kai_S_024: But, yes, I can imagine that.
MID_SE_Ism_Kai_S_025: <RSDS>Promised One, we might go our separate ways.
MID_SE_Ism_Kai_S_026: But I hope you'll keep watching me. I want to stand\nshoulder to shoulder with you someday.
MID_SE_Ism_Kai_S_027: I'll fight by your side again. That's a promise.